ario Connect, a solution used to create communities around specific health conditions to increase awareness and education; Dario Mind, a behavioral health offering that decreases the symptoms of stress, anxiety, and depression; Dario Move, focuses on improving posture to alleviate pain with medical device; and Dario Health, a self-care application and virtual coaching platform for diabetes, hypertension, and weight management and GLP-1. It also provides bundled full-suite or partial-suite subscriptions. The company was formerly known as LabStyle Innovations Corp. and changed its name to DarioHealth Corp. in July 2016. DarioHealth Corp. was incorporated in 2011 and is based in New York, New York."}}